  ('161e021f-2723-5731-86c1-1565bd676cc9', 'en-ak4-fler-klockan-2', 'Engelska', 'ak4', 'Klockan och dagen', 'Sam''s Saturday', 'En lördag med klockslag på engelska, och frågor om vad som står.', 16, 'vanlig', 'My name is Sam. On Saturdays I get up at half past eight. I have breakfast with my little sister, Nora. We eat bread with cheese and drink milk.

At ten o''clock I play football in the park with my friend Ali. We play for two hours. Then we go home and have lunch at twelve o''clock.

After lunch I read a book, and Nora draws pictures. At four o''clock we go to the shop with Dad and buy fruit.

In the evening we watch a film. Nora goes to bed at eight o''clock because she is only five. I go to bed at nine o''clock.', 'vag'),
