  ('68ec4c3f-2f37-5b8b-b185-9434dc259072', 'en-ak5-mastare-adjektiv', 'Engelska', 'ak5', 'Adjektiv', 'Mästarprov: Adjektiv', 'Blandade frågor ur hela området, i ny ordning varje gång. Klarar du det med minst två stjärnor sitter området.', 20, 'mastare', null, 'vag'),
  ('f59bb423-6e70-5182-b697-5c41353751af', 'en-ak5-fler-igar-1', 'Engelska', 'ak5', 'Igår och i helgen', 'Walked, played, cooked', 'Regelbundna verb i preteritum: de får -ed, som played och cooked.', 21, 'vanlig', null, 'vag'),
  ('e43937b3-69bc-55ac-a958-344b219f0fbe', 'en-ak5-fler-igar-2', 'Engelska', 'ak5', 'Igår och i helgen', 'A weekend with Tariq', 'En berättelse om en helg med en kusin, i preteritum, med frågor om vad som står.', 22, 'vanlig', 'Last weekend my cousin Tariq stayed at our house. He arrived on Friday evening, and we talked about our summer until midnight.

On Saturday morning we cooked pancakes for the whole family. I mixed the eggs, milk and flour, and Tariq cooked the pancakes. He dropped the first pancake on the floor, and our dog Bella ate it!

In the afternoon we walked to the lake and played football on the beach. Later we watched a film and laughed a lot.

On Sunday it rained, so we stayed inside and made a big castle out of boxes. When Tariq went home, I was a little sad. We promised to meet again in the holidays.', 'vag'),
  ('6969dd32-d472-50e3-9ae1-b7f849de6aa3', 'en-ak5-repetition', 'Engelska', 'ak5', 'Repetition', 'Repetition', 'Det du svarat fel på förut, blandat med sådant du redan klarat.', 23, 'repetition', null, 'vag'),
